    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d637-a1">

                <pb facs="0902" n="796" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg796"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Consul Proffit to Doctor McGreevy.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pretoria, Transvaal</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic">January 12,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your letter of November 22 last inclosing 31 notes, issued by the Government
                    of the late South African Republic, of the face value of £684, which you ask me
                    to present for payment to the officials of the British Government. Replying
                    thereto, you are advised that I shall be pleased to make a formal claim on your
                    behalf, though I fear that the issue will prove unsuccessful, as under the
                    treaty of peace signed by Great Britain and the late republics, these notes were
                    made a part of Great Britain’s liability only in cases in which they were issued
                    by officers of the said republics in return for supplies furnished or services
                    rendered. And section 10 of said treaty expressly excludes rebels and foreigners
                    from participation in the fund provided for the payment of said notes. However,
                    I shall prosecute your claim diligently, and communicate the result to you as
                    soon as possible.</p>
                <p>I have inclosed herewith a receipt for the notes in question.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Joseph E.
                    Proffit.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
